# E2E mode config for @axispoint/web — TEMPLATE (tracked in git).
#
# Copy this file to .env.e2e.local (which is gitignored and machine-local) and replace the
# placeholder with the real production GAS Web App /exec URL. Each dev machine (Mac or
# Windows) needs its own .env.e2e.local; the real value is never committed.
#
# `pnpm dev:e2e` reads the endpoint ONLY from .env.e2e.local. If it is missing, the dev
# server fails loudly instead of silently falling back to simulated success.
#
# WARNING: e2e mode hits the REAL backend. A submitted form creates a live lead, email,
# and calendar event.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=your_google_apps_script_exec_url_here
